  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "きょうぼうな　せいしつ。　てつぼうを\nかみちぎる　ほどの　アゴの　ちからで\nえものに　ばくりと　かみつく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "흉포한 성질을 가졌다. 철봉을\n물어뜯어 버릴 정도의 턱 힘으로\n먹이를 덥석 물어버린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "性情凶暴的寶可夢。\n會用能咬斷鐵棍的顎部\n大口咬住獵物。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "De nature très violente, il mord fermement\nses proies avec sa mâchoire, assez puissante\npour broyer une barre de fer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dieses von Natur aus aggressive Pokémon beißt\nseine Beute mit seinem kräftigen Kiefer, der\nselbst Eisenstangen zermalmen kann.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Un Pokémon de temperamento feroz que\natenaza a su presa con sus fuertes mandíbulas,\ncapaces de destrozar una barra de hierro.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ha una natura estremamente feroce e addenta\nle prede con la sua mascella, così potente da\npoter sbriciolare sbarre di ferro.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "With jaws that can shear through steel rods,\nthis highly aggressive Pokémon chomps down\non its unfortunate prey.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "狂暴な　性質。　鉄棒を\n噛み千切る　ほどの　顎の　力で\n獲物に　ばくりと　噛みつく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "性格凶暴的宝可梦。\n会用能咬断铁棍的颚部\n大口咬住猎物。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Un Pokémon de temperamento feroz que\natenaza a su presa con sus fuertes mandíbulas,\ncapaces de destrozar una barra de hierro.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "くびが　のびちぢみする。　はなれた\nところから　くびを　いっきに　のばし\nするどい　キバで　てきを　しとめる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "목을 자유자재로 늘이고 줄인다.\n떨어져 있는 곳에서 목을 단번에 늘여\n날카로운 이빨로 적의 숨통을 끊는다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "頸部可以伸縮。\n能從遠處迅速伸長頸部，\n用銳利的牙齒解決對手。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Son cou extensible lui permet d’atteindre\ndes ennemis éloignés en un instant pour leur\nporter un coup décisif avec ses crocs aiguisés.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sein streckbarer Hals ermöglicht es ihm, auch\nentfernte Gegner zu erreichen, die es dann mit\nseinen scharfen Zähnen ausschaltet.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su cuello extensible le permite alcanzar a los\nrivales a distancia. Hundiendo sus afilados\ndientes, les da el golpe de gracia.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ha un collo retrattile. Tenendosi a distanza dal\nnemico, lo estende all’improvviso per dare\nil colpo di grazia con i denti aguzzi.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon rapidly extends its retractable neck\nto sink its sharp fangs into distant enemies and\ntake them down.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "首が　伸び縮みする。　離れた\nところから　首を　一気に　伸ばし\n鋭い　キバで　敵を　しとめる。",
